    </string-array>
    <string name="ch23_rule_basic">每一顆按鈕不是永遠說真話，就是永遠說謊。</string>
    <string name="ch23_rule_spy">其中一顆是間諜：想說什麼就說什麼。</string>
    <string name="ch23_rule_double">The Button 的分身混在裡面。</string>
    <string name="ch23_goal_liars">標記所有說謊的，按「確定」。</string>
    <string name="ch23_goal_double">標記分身，按「確定」。</string>
    <string name="ch23_goal_spy">標記間諜，按「確定」。</string>
